// title: Entra sign-ins with the MSAppHost user agent, interactive and non-interactive (Microsoft Sentinel)
// date: 2026-11-23
// product: Entra
// tables: AADNonInteractiveUserSignInLogs, SigninLogs
// purpose: Threat Research: Sideloaded AppX package abuses Microsoft-signed web hosts to capture OAuth tokens (Huntress research)
// source: https://www.huntress.com/blog/stealing-oauth-tokens-through-microsofts-front-door
// kind: incident-note
// author: Threat Research analysis (the morning analysis)
// archived by tools/kql_archive.py (CLAUDE.md 5l, 5eu)
// Sideloaded AppX web-host OAuth token theft (Huntress) - sign-ins made through an AppX web host
// Microsoft Sentinel; diagnostic categories SignInLogs and NonInteractiveUserSignInLogs routed to the workspace
union isfuzzy=true SigninLogs, AADNonInteractiveUserSignInLogs
| where TimeGenerated > ago(30d)
| where UserAgent has "MSAppHost"
| summarize SignIns = count(), Apps = make_set(AppDisplayName, 10), IPs = make_set(IPAddress, 10), First = min(TimeGenerated) by UserPrincipalName, UserAgent
| order by SignIns desc
